# Terrain artefacts are pipeline output. Prettier must not reformat them: their
# exact bytes are the SHA-256s recorded in manifest.json, and collapsing a short
# array onto one line changes those bytes without changing the data. A rebuild
# has to reproduce these files byte for byte, so the generator's formatting is
# the authority here, not the formatter's. data/processed/README.md is hand
# written and is still formatted.
data/processed/*.json
